# Course root readme (mount)

Applies to **`en.md` and `vi.md` directly under** `.mount/data/courses/{index}-{slug}/` (not module or content nested paths).

## Conventions

- **Headings:** `#` keys use **camelCase** as below (case-sensitive).
- **Lists of items:** under each list section, entries are `## {orderIndex}` (0-based) then `### {field}` lines; value is the rest until the next `###` or `##`.
- **Scalars:** body under `# originalPrice`, `# coverImageUrl` is a single line (trimmed).

## Sections (locale-specific — mirror structure in both `en.md` and `vi.md`)

| Section | Shape |
|--------|--------|
| `# title` | one-line title |
| `# description` | paragraph |
| `# prerequisites` | `## n` → `### text` → body |
| `# qnas` | `## n` → `### question` / `### answer` → bodies (accept typo `### anwser` as alias for answer) |
| `# valuePropositions` | `## n` → `### text` → body |

## Sections (usually **English source** in `en.md` only)

| Section | Shape |
|--------|--------|
| `# originalPrice` | integer string, e.g. `1500000` |
| `# coverImageUrl` | full URL, one line |
| `# livestreamSessions` | `## n` → `### dayOfWeek` `### startTime` `### expectedEndTime` `### isOverridable` `### orderIndex` (`true`/`false`, times `HH:mm:ss`, day lowercase e.g. `monday`) |
| `# pricingPhases` | `## n` → `### phase` `### price` `### slotAvailable` `### orderIndex` (`null` allowed for price/slot on e.g. regular phase) |

## Do not

- Do not use a separate `data.json` for the same course when these sections are present in `en.md` (seed/parser should read from markdown). Prefer fixing heading keys over inventing new ones.
